The statute specifies that records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute[[cite:obs-e39de7a68df4c6fc6fbe183119867969b9fb703b "Records of the society are retained for the period named in the schedule of this statute."]]. According to the schedule, ledgers are kept for eleven calendar years and then shredded[[cite:obs-7e8b9a0cf66b89b103ada790a26071a55374bb3d "Ledgers: eleven calendar years, shredding afterwards."]].